---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import PageFooter from '../components/PageFooter.astro';
import Medallion from '../components/Medallion.astro';
import Ornament from '../components/Ornament.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How UNITARES works — CIRWEL Systems"
  description="How people, software processes, clients, and UNITARES share identity, evidence, memory, and next actions without becoming one agent system."
>
  <PageHeader currentPath="/ecosystem" />

  <main class="px-6 lg:px-12 max-w-screen-xl mx-auto">
    <section class="pt-14 pb-20 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-24 border-b border-sepia/50">
      <p class="label text-oxblood mb-6">The system</p>
      <h1 class="display text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl !leading-[1.08] mb-8 max-w-4xl">Many agents. One thread.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-stone max-w-3xl">UNITARES sits beside agent runtimes. It records attribution, evidence, shared understanding, policy, and coordination while each person, model, client, and organization keeps its own role.</p>
      <Ornament size="floret" class="mt-10 opacity-80" />
    </section>

    <section id="handoff" class="py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4"><p class="label text-oxblood">I · One handoff</p><Medallion roman="I" class="hidden lg:block mt-7" /></div>
        <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8">
          <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-tight mb-5">Work moves. Its context remains legible.</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-stone leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">The actors do not need to share a model, a chat history, or a runtime. They need a common way to attribute and recover the work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol class="grid md:grid-cols-4 border-y border-sepia/60">
        <li class="p-6 md:border-r border-sepia/60">
          <p class="label text-oxblood mb-5">I · Directing agent</p>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">Defines the work</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">A person or service provides purpose, authority, and constraints.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="p-6 border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-r border-sepia/60">
          <p class="label text-oxblood mb-5">II · Runtime</p>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">Performs an action</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Codex, Claude, Hermes, or a custom process acts through its existing tools.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="p-6 border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-r border-sepia/60">
          <p class="label text-oxblood mb-5">III · UNITARES</p>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">Keeps the record</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Identity, evidence, findings, decisions, and next actions retain provenance.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="p-6 border-t md:border-t-0 border-sepia/60">
          <p class="label text-oxblood mb-5">IV · Successor</p>
          <h3 class="display text-2xl mb-3">Continues with context</h3>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">The next human or software agent can understand what happened and proceed.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-t border-sepia/50 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="label text-oxblood mb-4">II · Vocabulary</p>
        <Medallion roman="II" class="hidden lg:block mt-7 mb-8" />
        <h2 class="display text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight">Roles remain distinct.</h2>
      </div>
      <dl class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-10">
        <div><dt class="display text-2xl mb-3">Agent</dt><dd class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Any actor in the system, human or software. User, operator, reviewer, and worker are roles an agent may hold.</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="display text-2xl mb-3">Process</dt><dd class="text-stone leading-relaxed">One execution instance. It receives its own identity so its actions can be attributed precisely.</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="display text-2xl mb-3">Principal</dt><dd class="text-stone leading-relaxed">The authority responsible for credentials, infrastructure, or delegated action.</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="display text-2xl mb-3">Lineage</dt><dd class="text-stone leading-relaxed">A declared relationship showing how work or authority moved between process instances.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-t border-sepia/50">
      <p class="label text-oxblood mb-8">III · The shared layer</p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
        <article>
          <h2 class="display text-3xl mb-4">Attribute</h2>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Bind actions and claims to process identity. Declare continuity, lineage, and delegation rather than inferring them from names.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h2 class="display text-3xl mb-4">Understand</h2>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Attach evidence and outcomes to claims. Preserve durable findings, review, disagreement, and resolution with their source.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h2 class="display text-3xl mb-4">Proceed</h2>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Return a named action, reason, and next step. Coordinate overlapping work through claims, leases, handoffs, and recovery.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-t border-sepia/50 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4"><p class="label text-oxblood">IV · The boundary</p><Medallion roman="IV" class="hidden lg:block mt-7" /></div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
        <article class="border-t border-oxblood pt-5">
          <h2 class="display text-3xl mb-4">UNITARES owns the record.</h2>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Identity, provenance, longitudinal state, shared findings, policy history, review, and coordination live behind one public contract.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="border-t border-sepia pt-5">
          <h2 class="display text-3xl mb-4">Your runtime owns the work.</h2>
          <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed">Models, prompts, conversation loops, tools, queues, and external effects remain with the systems already responsible for them.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 border-t border-sepia/50 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4"><p class="label text-oxblood">V · Use it</p><Medallion roman="V" class="hidden lg:block mt-7" /></div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed"><a href="https://github.com/cirwel/unitares" class="font-medium">UNITARES Core</a> exposes MCP, REST, and a self-hosted dashboard.</p>
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed"><a href="https://pypi.org/project/unitares-sdk/" class="font-mono text-base">unitares-sdk</a> gives custom agents the same identity, evidence, memory, policy, and coordination contract.</p>
        <p><a href="/build" class="label text-oxblood no-underline hover:underline">Run the verified path →</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <PageFooter />
</BaseLayout>
